Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.17,0:02:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}ﾄﾞﾝ･ｻｳｻﾞﾝﾄﾞ!?\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千尊主！？
